T1  - Association of calpain-10 polymorphisms with type 2 diabetes in the Tunisian population.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.diabet.2008.01.007
A1  - Kifagi, C
A1  - Makni, K
A1  - Mnif, F
A1  - Boudawara, M
