T1  - Physical activity and sedentary behaviors associated with risk of progression from gestational diabetes mellitus to type 2 diabetes mellitus: a prospective cohort study.
T3  - Comment in: JAMA Intern Med. 2014 Jul;174(7):1056-7. doi: 10.1001/jamainternmed.2014.709 PMID: 24841171 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/24841171] Comment in: Praxis (Bern 1994). 2014 Nov 12;103(23):1410-1. doi: 10.1024/1661-8157/a001828 PMID: 25391749 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/25391749]
