T1  - Healthful dietary patterns and type 2 diabetes mellitus risk among women with a history of gestational diabetes mellitus.
T3  - Comment in: Dtsch Med Wochenschr. 2013 Feb;138(8):347 PMID: 23530275 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23530275]
