T1  - Feasibility of a Lifestyle Intervention Program for Prevention of Diabetes Among Women With Prior Gestational Diabetes Mellitus (LIVING Study) in South Asia: A Formative Research Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3389/fgwh.2020.587607
A1  - Tewari, Abha
A1  - Praveen, Devarsetty
A1  - Madhira, Pavitra
A1  - Josyula, Lakshmi K
