T1  - Sugar-Lowering Drugs for Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus and Metabolic Syndrome-Review of Classical and New Compounds: Part-I.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3390/ph12040152
A1  - Vieira, Raquel
A1  - Souto, Selma B
A1  - Sanchez-Lopez, Elena
A1  - Machado, Ana Lopez
A1  - Severino, Patricia
A1  - Jose, Sajan
