T1  - Lactation and Progression to Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus After Gestational Diabetes Mellitus: A Prospective Cohort Study.
T3  - Summary for Patients in: Ann Intern Med. 2015 Dec 15;163(12). doi: 10.7326/P15-9038 PMID: 26595877 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/26595877] Comment in: BMJ. 2015;351:h6255 PMID: 26603979 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/26603979] Comment in: Ann Intern Med. 2016 Aug 16;165(4):299 PMID: 27538168 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/27538168] Comment in: Ann Intern Med. 2016 Aug 16;165(4):299-300 PMID: 27538169 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/27538169]
