T1  - Impaired microvascular insulin-dependent dilation in women with a history of gestational diabetes.
T3  - Comment in: Am J Physiol Heart Circ Physiol. 2024 Oct 1;327(4):H828-H829. doi: 10.1152/ajpheart.00572.2024 PMID: 39178031 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/39178031]
