T1  - Pharmacodynamics of Metformin in Pregnant Women With Gestational Diabetes Mellitus and Nonpregnant Women With Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/jcph.1549
A1  - Shuster, Diana L
A1  - Shireman, Laura M
A1  - Ma, Xiaosu
