T1  - The prevalence of gastrointestinal symptoms in patients with non-insulin dependent diabetes mellitus.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3904/kjim.2009.24.4.309
A1  - Oh, Jung-Hwan
A1  - Choi, Myung-Gyu
A1  - Kang, Moo-Il
