N2  - Epithelamine made in Russia (Samson, St. Petersburg) was tried for effects on carbohydrate metabolism and cardiovascular system in 33 patients with non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus (NIDDM). Adjuvant use of epithelamine in combined treatment of NIDDM promoted a stable compensation of carbohydrate metabolism, lowering of glycosylated hemoglobin, immunoreactive insulin. There was also a moderate hypotensive effect and improvement of left ventricular diastolic function.
