T1  - Alterations in basal and glucose-stimulated voltage-dependent Ca2+ channel activities in pancreatic beta cells of non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus GK rats.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1172/JCI118688
A1  - Kato, S
A1  - Ishida, H
A1  - Tsuura, Y
A1  - Tsuji, K
A1  - Nishimura, M
