T1  - Non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus complicated with idiopathic hypoparathyroidism.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2169/internalmedicine.34.904
A1  - Itoh, H
A1  - Matsuda, Y
A1  - Nishiyama, M
A1  - Kitagawa, T
