T1  - Hyperglycemia facilitates urinary excretion of C-peptide by increasing glomerular filtration rate in non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0026-0495(95)90015-2
A1  - Wasada, T
A1  - Kuroki, H
A1  - Arii, H
