T1  - The relationship between early diabetic nephropathy and control of plasma glucose in non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus. The effect of glycemic control on the development and progression of diabetic nephropathy in an 8-year follow-up study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/1056-8727(94)90005-1
A1  - Kawazu, S
