T1  - Effect of strict metabolic control on glucose handling by the liver and peripheral tissues in non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0168-8227(94)90099-x
A1  - Kawamori, R
A1  - Morishima, T
A1  - Ikeda, M
