T1  - Comparison of Clinical Efficacy and Safety of Metformin Sustained-Release Tablet (II) (Dulening) and Metformin Tablet (Glucophage) in Treatment of Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3389/fendo.2021.712200
A1  - Guo, Li-Xin
A1  - Liu, Guo-En
A1  - Chen, Li
A1  - Wang, Hai-Fang
A1  - Guo, Jian
A1  - Zheng, Xian-Ling
A1  - Duan, Bin-Hong
