T1  - Late-onset unilateral renal dysfunction combined with non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus and bronchial asthma following allogeneic bone marrow transplantation for acute lymphoblastic leukemia in a child.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/sj.bmt.1701462
A1  - Hirayama, M
